# Always Listening Mode - Continuous Intent Detection ✅

## Overview

Juno's **Always Listening Mode** provides continuous background monitoring for user intent, activating when wake words are detected and volume thresholds are exceeded. This mode operates independently of both Dictation Mode and Agent Mode while sharing the same Whisper transcription infrastructure.

## Architecture

### Three-Mode Voice System
| Mode | Trigger | Purpose | State |
|------|---------|---------|-------|
| **Dictation Mode** | Hold configured key | Voice-to-text typing | Orange mic |
| **Agent Mode** | Alt+D toggle | AI conversations | Blue mic + chat |
| **Always Listening** | Background continuous | Intent detection | Background active |

